OL,3,GNEWSACharity shop finds 13 bags of
OL,4,Aitems dumped outside
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Cambridgeshire charity is urging
OL,7,Fpeople to put "more thought" into what
OL,8,Fthey donate after bags of rubbish were
OL,9,Fdumped outside one of its shops.
OL,11,FDeafblind UK's charity shop in Yaxley,
OL,12,Fnear Peterborough, said 13 bags
OL,13,Fcontaining unwanted items and household
OL,14,Fwaste were left outside the store,
OL,15,Fwhile another five bags were found in
OL,16,Fthe store's bin.
OL,18,FShop manager Kirsty Lilley said the
OL,19,Fbags included muddy items, bottles and
OL,20,Fother rubbish.
